findings.proposed_fix:
Current line 177:
    return TraceHash(TracesOfFrobenius(C,2^13:B0:=2^12));
Replacement along the lines of:
    return TraceHash(func<p|p+1-#RationalPoints(ChangeRing(C,GF(p)))>);
guarded for bad window primes (primes where the reduced quartic is singular), e.g. select an EulerFactor-based value when p divides the discriminant of the quartic; or ship the missing TracesOfFrobenius(C::CrvPln,...) intrinsic. (Formula a_p = p+1-#C(F_p) validated against LMFDB for hyperelliptic curves; plain #ChangeRing(C,GF(p)) raises 'Bad argument types' for CrvPln[FldFin], so #RationalPoints is needed.)

